        },
        "answer": {
          "text": "Dear Mr Brown, I am writing to tell you that I cannot attend the club on Friday because I am ill. As a result, I am afraid that I will miss the meeting. Could you please send me the information about the trip by email? In addition, I would like to know the time and the place. Thank you very much for your help. I hope that I can come next week. Kind regards, Sam Lopez",
